# Deflecting Palm (CR 615.8): "the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn". Bot1 chooses Bot2's
# Fencing Ace (double strike, 1/1) as it attacks. Its first-strike damage is the next time: prevented, and the Palm deals that
# 1 damage to the Ace's controller, Bot2. The effect is then used up, so the regular damage 1 is dealt to Bot1: Bot1 19, Bot2 19.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Deflecting Palm
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Fencing Ace
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fencing Ace.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Fencing Ace > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deflecting Palm.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Fencing Ace)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 19
Prevented = 1 Fencing Ace > Bot1 by Deflecting Palm
